(*
Loop-variable capture (de-recursify deferred lift, Phase 1 — Task 4 fix).

An inlined `to:do:` induction var `i` is CAPTURED by a nested REAL block
(`b:: [ i ]`). Before the fix, `i` was given a Context slot and the loop's OWN
same-frame reads (`sum:: sum + i`) were rewritten to OP_LD_CTX against a slot the
inline loop codegen never writes -> nil -> crash. The fix keeps inlined-block-
managed captured locals register+home_ctx-homed (excluded from Context-homing),
so the same-frame read of `i` still works. `sum` accumulates 1+2+3 = 6.

LIMITATION (deferred): the nested block's captured `i` remains register+home_ctx-
homed and is therefore NOT upward/cross-fiber-safe (same as pre-phase). This test
only exercises the SAME-FRAME read, which is the regression point.

expect:
6
skip-berry: true
*)
class LoopVarCaptureTest packageUsing: manifest = () (
  public main: platform args: args = ( | sum |
    sum:: 0.
    1 to: 3 do: [:i | | b | b:: [ i ]. sum:: sum + i ].
    sum println.
    ^ 0
  )
) : (
)
